# Line-ending handling.
#
# Scripts and documentation are normalized so they render consistently on any
# platform. Population extracts under data/ are stored byte-for-byte as
# received, so their hashes stay stable — a data file that reports as modified
# should mean the population changed, not that Windows rewrote line endings.

*.ps1  text eol=crlf
*.md   text eol=lf

data/** -text
